## 12. Feature registry summary (check `plan/REGISTRY.md` before planning anything new)

**Already built — do not duplicate:** Patients · OPD & IPD registrations · Medicines (+ type / dosage-form / search caching) · Prescriptions (+ items, PDF, obstetric data, USG templates, history print-control) · Doctor profiles, specialities & fees · Wards / Rooms / Beds · Clinic fee config · Particulars & OPD payments (prepaid + refund) · Expense categories & records · Counter sessions · Amount handovers · Finance reports · Clinic feature flags (PrepaidOpd / Billing) · Subscription plans + gating · Centralized logging + action/audit logging · Vitals-preset lookup · History lookup items · States / Cities · Clinic locations · Pregnancy tenure + LMP tenure view.

`plan/REGISTRY.md` also holds the **Executed Features** log (dates, new entities/DbSets, file counts) and the current **Planned (not yet executed)** list — read it to check overlap or to record a new execution.

